<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Lend Lease year net profit edges up.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Lend Lease year net profit edges up.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   289.60 vs 294.60</p>
<p>    Net				    280.00 vs 260.10</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    47.00 vs 38.00</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    90.00 vs 85.00</p>
<p>    Sales (billion)			1.29 vs 1.46</p>
<p>    Other income			  772.9 vs 226.2</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   118.7 vs 116.5</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					 9.6 vs 34.5</p>
<p>    Interest				 20.4 vs 27.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   12.1 vs 12.2</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating profit before tax by industry segment.</p>
<p>    Property Services		    52.1 vs 129.1</p>
<p>    Financial services		  213.0 vs 147.0</p>
<p>    Capital Services/investments     12.4 vs 15.2</p>
<p>    Group Services			 12.1 vs 3.3</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating profit before tax by geographic segment.</p>
<p>    Australia			     247.1 vs 284.6</p>
<p>    Asia and Pacific		     37.8 vs 6.7</p>
<p>    Europe				    0.4 vs 1.3</p>
<p>    North America			   4.3 vs 2.0</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay date November 1</p>
<p>Reg date October 10</p>
<p>NOTE: Lend Lease Corporation Ltd is a construction, property development, funds management and civil engineering group.  </p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
